# Never publish the repository itself.
#
# `public/` IS the git working tree of the site repo, so a plain asset upload
# once put `/.git/config`, `/.git/HEAD` and the whole object store on the open
# web — the config carrying a real name and email. GitHub Pages 404s `.git`;
# the Worker mirror did not. This file is the only thing standing between the
# repo and anybody who asks for it.
.git
.git/**
